# `var asked = wish || {}` in a function that is copied in line into the loop of its caller: THE TURNS THAT RUN ARE THOSE OF THE COPY. The function's own walk kept its two turns under an earlier text and the
# copy lost them (125 | 212 instructions a turn; six ShapeTests gone out of f0): what is proven of the way that brings `wish` says something there that is no set of layouts. f0 = the module's body.
# A call stands between the join and the reads: there the way that brings the literal meets the other.
